Piskel 0.15.0
================================================================================

What is distributed here
------------------------
piskel-0.15.0.tar.gz is the unmodified source archive of the Piskel v0.15.0
release (https://github.com/piskelapp/piskel/releases/tag/v0.15.0, archive
https://github.com/piskelapp/piskel/archive/refs/tags/v0.15.0.tar.gz, sha256
8d9f45190bc39c82f8f41b1647bc817b8f21fd7522dc81801dec092294c582d9).
Homepage and source repository: https://github.com/piskelapp/piskel

piskel-0.15.0-prod.tar.gz holds prod/, the production build of that release
made with the project's own build ("grunt build", Gruntfile.js of the release)
and no change to any file: Node.js 10.24.1 (Docker image
node:10.24.1-buster-slim), "npm install --ignore-scripts" of the release's
package.json, then "grunt build", which writes dest/prod. The build stamps
a date into the bundle file names and into index.html; nothing else differs from what the project publishes
on piskelapp.com. server.py and start.sh are local launch scripts: they serve the
files of prod/ unchanged from the archive; no product file is modified.

